# --- runs/: all generated experiment output lives here ---
# Committed: run.json, bench/eval/gate result files, metrics.jsonl, figures, generated reports (provenance + report inputs).
# Ignored: bulky or regenerable artifacts.
runs/**/telemetry.jsonl
runs/**/telemetry/
runs/**/checkpoints/
runs/**/shards/
runs/**/raw/

# --- scratch/: temporary experiments and prototypes, not tracked (only its README) ---
scratch/*
!scratch/README.md

# --- scripts/legacy_v1/ (V1 baseline code): its local outputs and fetched data ---
out-*/
scripts/legacy_v1/data/*/*.json
export_to_hub.py
hugging_face_export/

# private working plan (local only)
/PLAN.md
/PLAN_M1.md
